## 8. Configuration & Scopes Discipline

* App permissions (scopes) and subscriptions are declarative. Maintain them in `shopify.app.toml`.
* When implementing a feature requiring new scopes (e.g., `read_orders, write_orders`), prompt the user to:
1. Update the `scopes` string in `shopify.app.toml`.
2. Restart the dev process with `npm run dev -- --reset` to trigger scope re-authorization in the test store.



