It covers about **90% of core technical compliance and architecture**, but it is missing one non-negotiable commercial requirement: **The Shopify Billing API**.

If your goal is to charge merchants $29 to $49/month, Shopify strictly forbids external payment processors (Stripe, Lemon Squeezy, PayPal) for apps listed on their App Store. Apps that include external payment links face immediate rejection. All recurring fees must be billed directly through Shopify's Native Billing API.

