## 11. API Throttling & GraphQL Cost Management

* Shopify enforces a leaky-bucket rate limit based on GraphQL query cost (maximum 1,000 cost points per shop, replenishing at 50 points/second).
* **No Unbounded Parallelism:** Never wrap bulk Shopify GraphQL mutations in unthrottled `Promise.all([...])`.
* Process batch operations sequentially or in controlled chunks (e.g., maximum 3-5 concurrent calls) to avoid triggering `MAX_COST_EXCEEDED` HTTP 429 errors.

